# LA-7 stdin script — drive Alex to the stove.
#
# Strategy: scan in 45° steps until a kitchen-appliance label is
# grounded, then goto. The stove in this scene sits behind+left of
# the spawn, so we expect to find it around 180-225°.
#
# We use face(yaw_rad) which the autonomy loop now closes the
# loop on (LA-7 commit 43522f5). The face skill returns "queued";
# the autonomy loop drives _cmd[2] until the current yaw is within
# 8° of target, then clears face_yaw_rad and lets the FSM resume.
#
# Each turn after the rotation completes we re-check scene_nodes.
# Once stove or oven is grounded, we goto. Phase 1-4's planner +
# follower take over from there.

```python
# Turn 1 — initial check at spawn yaw.
nodes = list_scene()["value"]
print("la7 t1 seen:", [(n["label"], n["world_xy"]) for n in nodes])
for label in ("stove", "oven", "microwave"):
    r = find(label)
    if r["status"] == "ok":
        goto(label)
        break
else:
    # Nothing useful yet — turn 45°.
    face(0.785)   # +45° in radians (pi/4 ≈ 0.785)
```
EOF

