```python
# Turn 9 — if a goto fired in any earlier turn, we won't reach here
# until Phase 1-4 finishes walking and the FSM goes back to ARRIVED.
# Declare success.
finish("LA-7: scan-and-goto complete (or Phase 1-4 took over)")
